    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A toy book made from a thick oval cover body and a slightly smaller flat oval page block. The spine is emphasised by working the cover in a bold colour and the page block in cream or white. A "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "glossaryTooltip",
              "attrs": {
                "termSlug": "colour-change"
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "colour change"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " at the spine edge creates a contrast binding strip. A title can be embroidered on the front cover."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Book cover"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Rounds: 21. Begin with a "
        },
