            {
              "type": "glossaryTooltip",
              "attrs": {
                "termSlug": "amigurumi-increase"
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "increase"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " to the full size. Work the body at full depth, stuffing before closing. Choose a bold colour for the cover. The oval shape gives the book a pleasingly chubby look."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Round 1: Chain 7. Working along chain: 2 sc in 2nd ch from hook, sc in next 4 ch, 3 sc in last ch, rotate. Along opposite side: sc in next 4 ch, 2 sc in last ch (16 st)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
